      "releaseNotes": "Better Godox A2 flash sync across more iPhones.\n\nHold on a photo and slide to adjust its exposure.\n\nPhotos in the cloud now come back in full quality, and your cloud library returns when you sign in on a new phone.\n\nGeneral performance improvements.",
